WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.012
Grouped summaries help us compare categories using the same statistics.

00:00:05.012 --> 00:00:09.402
The DataFrame contains scores for groups A and B.

00:00:09.402 --> 00:00:18.325
Groupby separates the records, and agg calculates count, mean, median, and standard deviation for each group.

00:00:18.934 --> 00:00:21.081
Compare both center and spread.

00:00:21.081 --> 00:00:26.596
A higher mean does not automatically mean every observation in that group is higher.

00:00:26.596 --> 00:00:32.940
Group summaries are a starting point for comparison, not a complete explanation of why groups differ.
